Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,motivation can make\Nyou go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.33,0:00:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,there to that place\Nand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,okay fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I want I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,start doing this and\Nmaine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,karna hai and I'm\Ngoing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to be able to do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And then your\Ndiscipline is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,something which\Nmakes you do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay theek hai, I\Nhave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And obsession is I\Ncan't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,do without it, I\Nhave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to fucking do it\Notherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to obsess,\Nobsess,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,obsess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And the ones who\Nmake
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it are the ones who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,make that obsession\Npart of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,their normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, you\Nsee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,motivation hat jaati\Nhai thodi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,der mein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But discipline aata\Nhai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But lekin ye India\Nmein
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,bahut difficult hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,India by inherent\Nhamari society
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,aisi hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our society is such\Nthat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we de-incentivize\Nobsession to become
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,number one in any\Nfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are like,\Nokay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,hey, you know what,\Nyou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,rated math, but you\Nshould
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,do this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you should not\Nbe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,obsessed with this\Nthing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or let's say if you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,are great at this\Nthing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,then you are like,\Noh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to be great
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,family relationships\Nas well. You
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,need to be great.\NDon't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,keep all your eggs\Nin
